<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11895" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεργ-ᾰσία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>finishing off,
			completing,</i> of painters, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν ἀ. τὴν τῶν εἰκόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					312d
				</span></i>
			; <i>execution, workmanship,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1448b18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>causing, producing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χάριτος καὶ ἡδονῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					4.62c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργου, ὑγιείας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Euthphr.</u>
				13d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνύλων εἰδῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Comm.Math.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>working off</i> of a debt, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1390.77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀ. τῶν νόσων</span>”
				<i>treatment,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					2.140b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ χώματος</span>”
				<i>upkeep,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					POxy.
					729.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>efficacy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐν ταῖς θυσίαις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					5.8
				</span></i>
			, al.</div>
